 "summary": "TotalSense is a Senva indoor air quality monitor with BACnet MS/TP. Analog Inputs give temperature, RH, dew point, CO2, TVOC, PM mass and counts, CO, ozone, light, occupancy, pressure, an air quality index and per-sensor status flags. Analog Values hold offsets, CO2 auto-calibration, relay and analog output setup, a built-in PID loop, air quality thresholds and display options.",
